          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "step2",
        "instruction": {
          "title": "Step 2: Watch the loop begin",
          "description": "Continue observing from Earth as Mars slows, reverses, and starts its westward loop. The path shown here highlights the retrograde segment."
